# Servicol Design System Tokens

All design tokens are defined in `src/app/globals.css` as Tailwind v4 `@theme` variables.
The source JSON files live in `src/tokens/` (exported from Figma). Do not invent colors, sizes, or values outside this system.

---

## Color Utilities

### Semantic (use these by default)

| Intent | Tailwind class | CSS variable |
|---|---|---|
| Page background | `bg-bg-canvas` | `var(--color-bg-canvas)` |
| Card / surface background | `bg-bg-surface` | `var(--color-bg-surface)` |
| Subtle / muted background | `bg-bg-subtle` | `var(--color-bg-subtle)` |
| Primary text | `text-text-primary` | `var(--color-text-primary)` |
| Secondary text | `text-text-secondary` | `var(--color-text-secondary)` |
| Muted / placeholder text | `text-text-muted` | `var(--color-text-muted)` |
| Text on dark backgrounds | `text-text-inverse` | `var(--color-text-inverse)` |
| Default border | `border-border-default` | `var(--color-border-default)` |
| Strong border | `border-border-strong` | `var(--color-border-strong)` |
| Primary action (black button) | `bg-action-primary` | `var(--color-action-primary)` |
| CTA / brand action (esmeralda) | `bg-action-cta` | `var(--color-action-cta)` |
| CTA light / tint | `bg-action-cta-light` | `var(--color-action-cta-light)` |
| Error / destructive | `text-action-error` / `bg-action-error` | `var(--color-action-error)` |

### Primitives (use sparingly, prefer semantic aliases above)

`bg-black` `bg-grafito` `bg-gris` `bg-plata` `bg-humo` `bg-niebla` `bg-white` `bg-esmeralda` `bg-esmeralda-light` `bg-error`

