## Typography

### Font families
- `font-display` → Figtree (headings, display text)
- `font-body` → Inter (body copy, UI text — default on `<body>`)
- `font-mono` → Fira Code (code, labels that need monospace)

### Font sizes (responsive — auto-adjust at md/lg breakpoints)
| Token | Mobile | Tablet | Desktop | Tailwind class |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| display-2xl | 32px | 40px | 56px | `text-display-2xl` |
| display-xl | 24px | 32px | 40px | `text-display-xl` |
| display-lg | 22px | 24px | 28px | `text-display-lg` |
| display-md | 18px | 20px | 22px | `text-display-md` |
| display-sm | 16px | 17px | 18px | `text-display-sm` |
| body-lg | 16px | 16px | 16px | `text-body-lg` |
| body-md | 14px | 14px | 14px | `text-body-md` |
| label | 11px | 11px | 11px | `text-label` |

### Font weights
`font-weight-light` (300) · `font-weight-regular` (400) · `font-weight-medium` (500) · `font-weight-bold` (700) · `font-weight-extrabold` (800)

### Line heights
`leading-tight` (1.1) · `leading-snug` (1.3) · `leading-normal` (1.5) · `leading-relaxed` (1.6)

### Letter spacing
`tracking-tight` (-0.5px) · `tracking-normal` (0) · `tracking-wide` (0.5px) · `tracking-wider` (1px)

