## Spacing

### Base scale (fixed, all breakpoints)
`--spacing-1` (4px) · `--spacing-2` (8px) · `--spacing-3` (12px) · `--spacing-4` (16px) · `--spacing-6` (24px) · `--spacing-8` (32px) · `--spacing-10` (40px) · `--spacing-12` (48px) · `--spacing-16` (64px) · `--spacing-20` (80px) · `--spacing-24` (96px)

Use as arbitrary values when needed: `p-[var(--spacing-6)]` or `gap-[var(--spacing-4)]`.

### Responsive contextual tokens (use via `var()` or arbitrary values)
| Token | Mobile | Tablet | Desktop |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--section-y` | 48px | 72px | 96px |
| `--section-x` | 20px | 40px | 80px |
| `--card-padding` | 16px | 20px | 24px |
| `--card-gap` | 12px | 16px | 20px |
| `--nav-height` | 56px | 64px | 72px |
| `--content-max` | 390px | 768px | 1280px |

Usage example:
```tsx
<section className="py-[var(--section-y)] px-[var(--section-x)]">
<div className="max-w-[var(--content-max)] mx-auto">
```

